  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/75a9edddcca2f782014371f75dca39d7e13a9c1b" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:2.064ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle H}"/></span> such that</p>

<ul id="mwWw"><li id="mwXA">The fibers <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt56" id="mwXQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"W_x"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle W_{x}}">
  <semantics>
