  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/e49daf3a66e7ac4c46c19ef371b3868616acc1df" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:3.366ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle W_{x}}"/></span> over closed points <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt57" id="mwXg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"x \\in H"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle x\in H}">
