        <mi>x</mi>
        <mo>∈<!-- ∈ --></mo>
        <mi>H</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle x\in H}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/af0957496d2596a81d84e50252c806c5ae488396" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:6.234ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle x\in H}"/></span> are closed subschemes of <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt58" id="mwXw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"X"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle X}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>X</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle X}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/68baa052181f707c662844a465bfeeb135e82bab" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.98ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle X}"/></span>. For <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt59" id="mwYA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"Y \\subset X"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle Y\subset X}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>Y</mi>
        <mo>⊂<!-- ⊂ --></mo>
        <mi>X</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle Y\subset X}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/22ed7bcf8cec0dba504a57e067b74f9f85f1ea0b" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:6.852ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle Y\subset X}"/></span> denote this point <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt60" id="mwYQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"x"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle x}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>x</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle x}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/87f9e315fd7e2ba406057a97300593c4802b53e4" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.33ex; height:1.676ex;" alt="{\displaystyle x}"/></span> as <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt61" id="mwYg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"[Y] \\in H"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle [Y]\in H}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mo stretchy="false">[</mo>
        <mi>Y</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">]</mo>
        <mo>∈<!-- ∈ --></mo>
        <mi>H</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle [Y]\in H}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/a135dcd2f6dc2e096991339038c32b5623882ff5" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:7.971ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle [Y]\in H}"/></span>.</li>
<li id="mwYw"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt62" id="mwZA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"H"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle H}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>H</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle H}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/75a9edddcca2f782014371f75dca39d7e13a9c1b" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:2.064ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle H}"/></span> is universal with respect to all flat families of subschemes of <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt63" id="mwZQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"X"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle X}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>X</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle X}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/68baa052181f707c662844a465bfeeb135e82bab" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.98ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle X}"/></span> having Hilbert polynomial <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt64" id="mwZg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"P"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle P}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>P</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle P}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/b4dc73bf40314945ff376bd363916a738548d40a" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.745ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle P}"/></span>. That is, given a scheme <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt65" id="mwZw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"T"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle T}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>T</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle T}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/ec7200acd984a1d3a3d7dc455e262fbe54f7f6e0" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.636ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle T}"/></span> and a flat family <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt66" id="mwaA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"W&apos; \\subset X\\times T"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle W'\subset X\times T}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msup>
          <mi>W</mi>
          <mo>′</mo>
        </msup>
        <mo>⊂<!-- ⊂ --></mo>
        <mi>X</mi>
        <mo>×<!-- × --></mo>
        <mi>T</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle W'\subset X\times T}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/119390aa296ad1fa607ce13b1dd67978fb09480a" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:12.748ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle W'\subset X\times T}"/></span>, there is a unique morphism <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt67" id="mwaQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\phi: T \\to H"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \phi :T\to H}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>ϕ<!-- ϕ --></mi>
        <mo>:</mo>
        <mi>T</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">→<!-- → --></mo>
        <mi>H</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle \phi :T\to H}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/88cfbcd0a217bf3120001c6a097741ef7e6d9104" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:10.637ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \phi :T\to H}"/></span> such that <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt68" id="mwag" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\phi^*W \\cong W&apos;"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \phi ^{*}W\cong W'}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msup>
          <mi>ϕ<!-- ϕ --></mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mo>∗<!-- ∗ --></mo>
          </mrow>
        </msup>
        <mi>W</mi>
        <mo>≅<!-- ≅ --></mo>
        <msup>
          <mi>W</mi>
          <mo>′</mo>
        </msup>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle \phi ^{*}W\cong W'}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/6648b2909b38e4fa58da0e216280647e866c461a" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:11.166ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \phi ^{*}W\cong W'}"/></span>.</li></ul>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="4" id="mwaw" aria-labelledby="Tangent_space"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Tangent_space">Tangent space</h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Hilbert_scheme&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4" title="Edit section: Tangent space"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwbA">The tangent space of the point <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt69" id="mwbQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"[Y] \\in H"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle [Y]\in H}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mo stretchy="false">[</mo>
        <mi>Y</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">]</mo>
        <mo>∈<!-- ∈ --></mo>
        <mi>H</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle [Y]\in H}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/a135dcd2f6dc2e096991339038c32b5623882ff5" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:7.971ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle [Y]\in H}"/></span> is given by the global sections of the normal bundle <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt70" id="mwbg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"N_{Y/X}"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle N_{Y/X}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msub>
          <mi>N</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>Y</mi>
            <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
              <mo>/</mo>
            </mrow>
            <mi>X</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle N_{Y/X}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/cd9a424406128dc51e5f8499bdf8d8a04b349ce5" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.171ex; width:5.574ex; height:3.009ex;" alt="{\displaystyle N_{Y/X}}"/></span>; that is,</p>
<dl id="mwbw"><dd id="mwcA"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt71" id="mwcQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"T_{[Y]}H = H^0(Y, N_{Y/X})"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle T_{[Y]}H=H^{0}(Y,N_{Y/X})}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msub>
          <mi>T</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mo stretchy="false">[</mo>
            <mi>Y</mi>
            <mo stretchy="false">]</mo>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mi>H</mi>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <msup>
          <mi>H</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>0</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msup>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <mi>Y</mi>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <msub>
          <mi>N</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>Y</mi>
            <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
              <mo>/</mo>
            </mrow>
            <mi>X</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle T_{[Y]}H=H^{0}(Y,N_{Y/X})}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/2f54fcaee31afddd698c2c78ea5718baae038265" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.171ex; width:22.269ex; height:3.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle T_{[Y]}H=H^{0}(Y,N_{Y/X})}"/></span></dd></dl>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="5" id="mwcg" aria-labelledby="Unobstructedness_of_complete_intersections"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Unobstructedness_of_complete_intersections">Unobstructedness of complete intersections</h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Hilbert_scheme&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5" title="Edit section: Unobstructedness of complete intersections"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwcw">For local complete intersections <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt72" id="mwdA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"Y"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle Y}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>Y</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle Y}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/961d67d6b454b4df2301ac571808a3538b3a6d3f" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.171ex; width:1.773ex; height:2.009ex;" alt="{\displaystyle Y}"/></span> such that <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt73" id="mwdQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"H^1(Y,N_{X/Y}) = 0"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle H^{1}(Y,N_{X/Y})=0}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msup>
          <mi>H</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>1</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msup>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <mi>Y</mi>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <msub>
          <mi>N</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>X</mi>
            <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
              <mo>/</mo>
            </mrow>
            <mi>Y</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <mn>0</mn>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle H^{1}(Y,N_{X/Y})=0}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/9f4495a2395ced354742a76de13416e44c1b9eb3" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.171ex; width:17.61ex; height:3.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle H^{1}(Y,N_{X/Y})=0}"/></span>, the point <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt74" id="mwdg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"[Y]\\in H"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle [Y]\in H}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mo stretchy="false">[</mo>
        <mi>Y</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">]</mo>
        <mo>∈<!-- ∈ --></mo>
        <mi>H</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle [Y]\in H}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/a135dcd2f6dc2e096991339038c32b5623882ff5" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:7.971ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle [Y]\in H}"/></span> is smooth. This implies every <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deformation_theory" title="Deformation theory" class="mw-redirect" id="mwdw">deformation</a> of <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt75" id="mweA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"Y"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle Y}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>Y</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle Y}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/961d67d6b454b4df2301ac571808a3538b3a6d3f" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.171ex; width:1.773ex; height:2.009ex;" alt="{\displaystyle Y}"/></span> in <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt76" id="mweQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"X"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle X}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>X</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle X}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/68baa052181f707c662844a465bfeeb135e82bab" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.98ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle X}"/></span> is unobstructed.</p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="6" id="mweg" aria-labelledby="Dimension_of_tangent_space"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Dimension_of_tangent_space">Dimension of tangent space</h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Hilbert_scheme&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6" title="Edit section: Dimension of tangent space"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwew">In the case <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt77" id="mwfA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"H^1(Y,N_{X/Y}) \\neq 0"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle H^{1}(Y,N_{X/Y})\neq 0}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msup>
          <mi>H</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>1</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msup>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <mi>Y</mi>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <msub>
          <mi>N</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>X</mi>
            <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
              <mo>/</mo>
            </mrow>
            <mi>Y</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
        <mo>≠<!-- ≠ --></mo>
        <mn>0</mn>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
