<p id="mwgA">In addition to these properties, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Francis_Sowerby_Macaulay" title="Francis Sowerby Macaulay" about="#mwt81" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwgQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"harvs","href":"./Template:Harvs"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"txt"},"last":{"wt":"Macaulay"},"first":{"wt":"Francis Sowerby"},"authorlink":{"wt":"Francis Sowerby Macaulay"},"year":{"wt":"1927"}},"i":0}}]}'>Francis Sowerby<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>Macaulay</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt81"> </span><span about="#mwt81">(</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#CITEREFMacaulay1927" about="#mwt81" class="mw-selflink-fragment">1927</a><span about="#mwt81">)</span> determined for which polynomials the Hilbert scheme <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt83" id="mwgg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\mathbf{Hilb}(n, P)"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \mathbf {Hilb} (n,P)}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
          <mi mathvariant="bold">H</mi>
