    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle \mathbf {Hilb} (n,P)}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/3e5a983f96e02fb15e733a46e57b786b5972dd60" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:11.044ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \mathbf {Hilb} (n,P)}"/></span> is non-empty, and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robin_Hartshorne" title="Robin Hartshorne" about="#mwt82" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwgw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"harvs","href":"./Template:Harvs"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"txt"},"last":{"wt":"Hartshorne"},"first":{"wt":"Robin"},"author-link":{"wt":"Robin Hartshorne"},"year":{"wt":"1966"}},"i":0}}]}'>Robin<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>Hartshorne</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt82"> </span><span about="#mwt82">(</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#CITEREFHartshorne1966" about="#mwt82" class="mw-selflink-fragment">1966</a><span about="#mwt82">)</span> showed that if <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt84" id="mwhA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\mathbf{Hilb}(n, P)"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \mathbf {Hilb} (n,P)}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
          <mi mathvariant="bold">H</mi>
          <mi mathvariant="bold">i</mi>
          <mi mathvariant="bold">l</mi>
          <mi mathvariant="bold">b</mi>
        </mrow>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <mi>n</mi>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <mi>P</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
      </mstyle>
