            <mo stretchy="false">]</mo>
          </mrow>
        </msup>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle M^{[2]}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/88c79b606965d5920779d966b9388dce8dd95efd" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:4.468ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle M^{[2]}}"/></span> is a blow-up of a symmetric square of <span class="texhtml mvar" style="font-style:italic;" about="#mwt175" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwATQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"mvar","href":"./Template:Mvar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"M"}},"i":0}}]}'>M</span>. Singularities of <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt181" id="mwATU" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\operatorname{Sym}^2 M"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \operatorname {Sym} ^{2}M}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
